  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
  <style>
    .policy-page { background: #f8fafc; min-height: 100vh; }
    .policy-nav { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 20px 0; }
    .policy-nav-content { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .policy-logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; text-decoration: none; }
    .policy-logo span { color: #3b82f6; }
    .policy-hero { background: #fff; padding: 60px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center; }
    .policy-hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .policy-hero p { color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
    .policy-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px; background: #fff; }
    .policy-section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .policy-section h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .policy-section p { color: #475569; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 15px; }
    .policy-section ul { color: #475569; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 24px; }
    .policy-section li { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px; }
    .cookie-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 24px 0; }
    .cookie-table th, .cookie-table td { text-align: left; padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 14px; }
    .cookie-table th { background: #f8fafc; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; }
    .cookie-table td { color: #475569; }
    .cookie-table td:first-child { font-weight: 500; color: #334155; }
    .cookie-category { background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .cookie-category h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
    .cookie-category p { font-size: 14px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 0; }
    .cookie-tag { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .tag-essential { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .tag-analytical { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
    .tag-functional { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
    .tag-marketing { background: #fce7f3; color: #9d174d; }
    .consent-banner { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .consent-banner h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .consent-banner p { font-size: 14px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) { .policy-hero h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; } .cookie-table { font-size: 12px; } .cookie-table th, .cookie-table td { padding: 8px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="policy-page">
    <nav class="policy-nav">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="policy-nav-content">
          <a href="/" class="policy-logo">Cover<span>Score</span> AI</a>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;">
            <a href="/auth/login" style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;">Sign In</a>
            <a href="/assessment/start" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Get Started</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="policy-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: March 15, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="policy-content">
      <div class="consent-banner">
        <h3>What are cookies?</h3>
        <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help websites remember your preferences and understand how you interact with content. This policy explains how CoverScore AI uses cookies and similar technologies.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>1. Categories of Cookies We Use</h2>
        <div class="cookie-category">
          <h3><span class="cookie-tag tag-essential">Essential</span> Essential Cookies</h3>
          <p>These cookies are required for the website to function properly. They enable core functionality such as secure login, session management, and load balancing. Without these cookies, certain services cannot be provided.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cookie-category">
          <h3><span class="cookie-tag tag-analytical">Analytical</span> Analytical Cookies</h3>
          <p>These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our website by collecting and reporting information anonymously. This helps us identify usage patterns and improve our platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cookie-category">
          <h3><span class="cookie-tag tag-functional">Functional</span> Functional Cookies</h3>
          <p>These cookies enable enhanced functionality and personalization, such as remembering your preferences (language, region) and providing improved features based on your usage history.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cookie-category">
          <h3><span class="cookie-tag tag-marketing">Marketing</span> Marketing Cookies</h3>
          <p>These cookies are used to track visitors across websites to display relevant advertisements. They may be set by us or by third-party advertising partners with our permission.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>2. Detailed Cookie List</h2>
        <table class="cookie-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Cookie Name</th>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Purpose</th>
              <th>Duration</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>_coverscore_session</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-essential">Essential</span></td>
              <td>Manages your logged-in session and security</td>
              <td>Session</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>accessToken</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-essential">Essential</span></td>
              <td>Stores your authentication token for API access</td>
              <td>7 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>csrf_token</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-essential">Essential</span></td>
              <td>Cross-Site Request Forgery protection</td>
              <td>Session</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>_ga</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-analytical">Analytical</span></td>
              <td>Google Analytics - distinguishes unique visitors</td>
              <td>2 years</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>_gid</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-analytical">Analytical</span></td>
              <td>Google Analytics - distinguishes unique visitors</td>
              <td>24 hours</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>_gat_gtag</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-analytical">Analytical</span></td>
              <td>Google Analytics - request rate limiting</td>
              <td>1 minute</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>cookie_consent</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-essential">Essential</span></td>
              <td>Stores your cookie consent preferences</td>
              <td>1 year</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>preferred_language</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-functional">Functional</span></td>
              <td>Remembers your language preference</td>
              <td>1 year</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>last_assessment</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-functional">Functional</span></td>
              <td>Stores your last assessment progress</td>
              <td>30 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>_fbp</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-marketing">Marketing</span></td>
              <td>Facebook Pixel - ad tracking</td>
              <td>3 months</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>li_sugr</td>
              <td><span class="cookie-tag tag-marketing">Marketing</span></td>
              <td>LinkedIn Insight Tag - ad matching</td>
              <td>90 days</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
        <p>Some cookies are placed by third-party services that appear on our pages. We use the following third-party services:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> To understand how visitors use our website. Google Analytics collects information anonymously and reports website trends.</li>
          <li><strong>Stripe:</strong> For secure payment processing. Stripe may set cookies to prevent fraud and ensure secure transactions.</li>
          <li><strong>Intercom:</strong> For customer support chat functionality. Intercom uses cookies to identify users and track conversations.</li>
          <li><strong>Facebook & LinkedIn:</strong> For advertising and conversion tracking. These cookies help us measure ad effectiveness.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>4. How Long Do Cookies Last?</h2>
        <p>Cookies can be either session cookies or persistent cookies:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Session Cookies:</strong> Deleted when you close your browser. They help facilitate tasks like navigation and购物 cart management during a single browsing session.</li>
          <li><strong>Persistent Cookies:</strong> Remain on your device for a set period (ranging from 24 hours to 2 years) and are reactivated each time you revisit the website that created them.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>5. Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2>
        <p>You have several options for managing cookies:</p>
        <h3>5.1 Browser Controls</h3>
        <p>Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can typically:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>View what cookies are stored on your device</li>
          <li>Delete all or specific cookies</li>
          <li>Block cookies from all or certain websites</li>
          <li>Block third-party cookies</li>
          <li>Clear all cookies when you close the browser</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Instructions for common browsers:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Chrome:</strong> Settings → Privacy and Security → Cookies</li>
          <li><strong>Firefox:</strong> Options → Privacy & Security → Cookies</li>
          <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences → Privacy → Cookies</li>
          <li><strong>Edge:</strong> Settings → Privacy & Services → Cookies</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>5.2 Cookie Consent Banner</h3>
        <p>When you first visit our website, you'll see a cookie consent banner where you can accept or reject non-essential cookies. You can change your preferences at any time by contacting us or by clearing cookies.</p>
        <h3>5.3 Opt-Out Links</h3>
        <p>You can opt out of specific third-party cookies:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" style="color: #3b82f6;">Google Analytics Opt-Out</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/ads/preferences" style="color: #3b82f6;">Facebook Ad Preferences</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/psettings/ads" style="color: #3b82f6;">LinkedIn Ad Settings</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>6. Impact of Disabling Cookies</h2>
        <p>If you choose to disable cookies, please note that some features of our website may not function properly:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>You may need to log in each time you visit</li>
          <li>Your preferences may not be saved</li>
          <li>Some interactive features may be limited</li>
          <li>Payment processing may be affected</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>7. Updates to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Cookie Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices or for other operational, legal, or regulatory reasons. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For questions about our use of cookies or this Cookie Policy, please contact us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@coverscore.ai" style="color: #3b82f6;">privacy@coverscore.ai</a></li>
          <li><strong>Mail:</strong> CoverScore AI, Inc., Attn: Privacy Team, 123 Insurance Lane, San Francisco, CA 94102</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

